 that finds them?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Voyager 1 and 2 carry records assembled with Carl Sagan\'s guidance, including music, spoken greetings, and sounds and images intended to represent life on Earth.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad53-725d-a257-89b3ab572600","description":"Voyager 1 and 2","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad53-7616-a8f1-82a43d670196","description":"Pioneer 10 and 11","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad53-720f-8f4b-d640ad280b53","description":"Viking 1 and 2","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad53-7fb9-bb13-6237ef1406a5","description":"Mariner 6 and 7","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad53-737c-8dff-93153c69a691","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What birth defect, whose name means \'divided spine\', is credited with being reduced by folic acid?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Spina bifida occurs when the neural tube does not close completely early in pregnancy; adequate folic acid before and during early pregnancy lowers the risk.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad53-78ab-bbf0-15cc366bb500","description":"Spina bifida","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad53-77ac-adc1-680a8d3fe3b4","description":"Down syndrome","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad53-7324-b9de-34d42b8ae1d1","description":"Cleft lip","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad53-7146-a3e0-9d02dd6debd0","description":"Clubfoot","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad53-73aa-b2db-eca0bcea524e","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What is the medical term for the kneecap?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"The patella is embedded in the quadriceps tendon and helps the muscle straighten the knee more effectively.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad53-7ab4-bb74-9871e2e18c4e","description":"Patella","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad53-71b5-907d-4c80f7974363","description":"Humerus","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad53-7091-8fde-66b7cdccc7f4","description":"Femur","correc